    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27397" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διπλ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>repeat</i> a process, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>APo.</u>
				91a21
			</span></i>; <i>double,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίβωνα,</span> of philosophers, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				6.22
			</span></i>; <i>multiply by two,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				159.27
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐδεδίπλωτο ἡ φάλαγξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					6.5.19
				</span></i>
			; of swords, <i>to be bent double,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cam.</u>
				41
			</span></i>; of a bow-string, <i><span class="en">
				Ach.Tat.
				3.8
			</span></i>; of fevers (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διπλοῦς</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				7.472
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεδιπλωμένον ἔμβρυον,</span> of
			position of foetus at birth, Aspasia ap.<i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				16.22
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				2.55
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>repay twofold,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. διπλᾶ κατὰ τὰ ἔργα αὐτῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Apoc.</u>
					18.6
				</span></i>
			.</div>
